          "element": "",
          "name": "74HC08",
          "text": "* 74HC08 behavioural model: digital cells (Y lines), evaluated outside the circuit equations; the levels follow the supply pins, the outputs have 60 ohm. Propagation delay 10 ns.\n.subckt 74HC08 a1 b1 y1 a2 b2 y2 gnd y3 a3 b3 y4 a4 b4 vcc\nY1 and y1 0 gnd vcc 60 0.5 0 0 0 td=10n a1 b1\nY2 and y2 0 gnd vcc 60 0.5 0 0 0 td=10n a2 b2\nY3 and y3 0 gnd vcc 60 0.5 0 0 0 td=10n a3 b3\nY4 and y4 0 gnd vcc 60 0.5 0 0 0 td=10n a4 b4\n.ends 74HC08",
          "pins": [
            "1",
